{"The replacement text in the Lithuanian locale file is Italian instead of Lithuanian - wrong language translation was applied": 0.9930754899978638, "POLICY_SOME_HTML, POLICY_NO_HTML, and HTML_TAGS are instance fields but do not depend on instance state - they are effectively constants. This causes unnecessary HtmlPolicyBuilder and Pattern.compile() calls for every file processed. Should be declared as private static final fields": 0.5838981866836548, "When the English counterpart file does not exist, a RuntimeException is thrown which propagates past the catch (IOException e) block, producing a confusing stack trace instead of a clear validation message. Should catch IOException and add a descriptive entry to messages or re-throw as MojoExecutionException": 0.720060408115387}